pkg:Evidence_v1_6_3 a quality:Evidence, owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Gate transcript for code-abundance-rdodi v1.6.3 (PATCH release)"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "PATCH: user directly challenged the previous turn's offer to 'close all 7' L3 gaps, pointing out the lineage is still at Backlog stage with zero PBIs planned or Done. Confirmed by direct query before responding: 5/5 WorkItems Proposed, 0 PlanningEvent, 0 Iteration, 0 KickOff, 0 DeploymentUnit. Re-examined each of the 3 remaining gap classes against this reality rather than proceeding with the prior offer. Mission outcome (Out_InFlight) and Epic-level Definition of Done (appliesDefinitionOfDone, reusing the existing Backlog-level DoD rather than duplicating it) are both true, no-progress-claimed classifications/criteria statements, legitimately authorable before any work starts -- closed. The 6 (actually 5, prior turn's count was off by one) objective checkpoints each require a real checkpointDate + expectedValue prediction, which with zero planning in place would be fabricated -- the same G31 anti-pattern already caught and removed once this session. Explicitly left open rather than closed. Re-verified: pipeline order unchanged (5/5 digests reproduce), L2 still 0 violations, L3 re-test-driven 7 -> 5, matching exactly the 2 legitimate closures with the 5 checkpoint violations correctly untouched."@en ;
    pub:transcriptSHA256 "f5cdb2875c1a98ee7e51a17826da15d160d97bef4ae9820c48f90dccf0ed6619"^^xsd:string .
